[{"client_msg_id":"b3be0a93-3578-4a53-95a5-bd476d36b808","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Option と Result でどっちを使うか迷う、ってのはちょっと分かりますね。もちろんデータ構造的に異なるのは分かりますが、実際に関数のシグニチャを設計するときにどっちを使うべきか悩む場合があるという話で。\n「私が作ったこの構造体からこのメソッドで値を取り出せなかった場合、単に None を吐くべきか？それとも Err を吐くべきか？」って悩むことはよくあります。\nとはいえそれは大概どの言語でも同じ（たとえば Python なら `return None` とすべきか `raise Exception` とすべきかという話になるだけ）なので、Rust のせいだとは思いませんが。","ts":"1624745804.137400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ssX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"397f7d40-88d0-42e5-928f-b3bc6d72ad09","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"まぁ「欲しそう」であって「欲しい」ってなったことないですがｗ","ts":"1624725463.132800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01TQP86UM6"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k4Ov"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2577bb1-2f2e-4fca-90d7-2b1c6feab491","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"純粋にEitherが欲しいというのもまあわかる","ts":"1624725302.132200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kk1k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a0a66ca-ed69-437b-afec-1bac7ee01daa","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"エラーハンドリング用途で使うならこれだと不便なのでResult使ってしまうというのは分かり","ts":"1624725285.131900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XsiFK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9aaf06f9-ea8a-45db-b943-2665faa437a0","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://docs.rs/either/1.6.1/either/\u003e\n\nこれかな？それともクレート独自だったかな？どのクレートだったかも思い出せないですが、戸惑った記憶だけありますｗ","ts":"1624725141.131300","attachments":[{"fallback":"either - Rust","id":1,"title":"either - Rust","title_link":"https://docs.rs/either/1.6.1/either/","text":"API documentation for the Rust `either` crate.","blocks":null,"service_name":"docs.rs","service_icon":"https://docs.rs/favicon-20200915-1.48.0-nightly-6af1bdda5.ico","from_url":"https://docs.rs/either/1.6.1/either/","original_url":"https://docs.rs/either/1.6.1/either/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z8c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0b026ae-35e2-451a-a0bf-25543647beed","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"まれに Either 使ってるのがあったりして戸惑いました","ts":"1624725099.130700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MJ3Fm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45796374-1bfe-493b-a357-86c88976fa77","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://zenn.dev/helloyuki/scraps/e5af11fecac719\u003e","ts":"1624725070.130300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iCCT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da584c3f-81b3-4d9f-8639-5dd6be9add96","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"名前が制約を決めちゃうのあるあるですね","ts":"1624725059.130100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3s2xV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea24cf77-685f-467b-a63c-56eb7de5063d","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"Result って名前のせいで Either 的な使い方しにくいってのはある気がします","ts":"1624725034.129700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d6MY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2a43034-a1fa-4173-bc4c-d001991d46d8","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`Option vs Maybe` ならわかる","ts":"1624724996.129200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QvR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52b8b43d-438d-4741-9197-f0a63ef7785a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なるほど","ts":"1624724986.128800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sYI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"222fc501-a060-4b0a-afd4-877674adc0a4","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`Option` って片方しか値無いので `Result` と比較するのはちょっと違う気がします...","ts":"1624724975.128600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P2wg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d73816a-6236-462e-a54b-0984b708a09a","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"どっちかってと `Result` じゃなくて `Either` がほしい的な話はよく見ますね","ts":"1624724932.127800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XOwr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1dbf20c-a596-49eb-9e96-cb8254cc52e2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"エラー部分が必要か否かではっきりと決まる印象があった","ts":"1624724858.127300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jr="}]},{"client_msg_id":"6daeffb2-2107-4aa0-9615-e1ecf9195d12","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CGABGC8LA/p1624724301168000\u003e\nOptionとResultの使い分けは割とはっきりしているイメージあったけどそうでもない？","ts":"1624724845.126800","attachments":[{"fallback":"[June 26th, 2021 9:18 AM] yuniruyuni: 逆に悪い例だとこの辺がrustがよくなくて、Option, Result, errorやらの使い分けが慣習確立してないよねみたいな話とか出てくる。一方でOptionというもの1つだけを取り上げたらこれは十分面白いなってなる。言語環境として捉えるモノの範囲を広げると似たようなものが登場してしまうので、慣習として言えるものは減るみたいな逆転現象があるかなと思う。究極的にはプログラミング全体まで広げると、今のデファクトスタンダードの全体像だけが慣習として残るのかな。","id":1,"author_id":"U023NC4J1UP","author_name":"ゆにるゆに","author_subname":"ゆにるゆに","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U023NC4J1UP","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2021-06-04/2132402931590_a3a3e7bf4a1de62b3dd9_48.png","text":"逆に悪い例だとこの辺がrustがよくなくて、Option, Result, errorやらの使い分けが慣習確立してないよねみたいな話とか出てくる。一方でOptionというもの1つだけを取り上げたらこれは十分面白いなってなる。言語環境として捉えるモノの範囲を広げると似たようなものが登場してしまうので、慣習として言えるものは減るみたいな逆転現象があるかなと思う。究極的にはプログラミング全体まで広げると、今のデファクトスタンダードの全体像だけが慣習として残るのかな。","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #lang-go","ts":1624724301.168000,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CGABGC8LA/p1624724301168000","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CGABGC8LA/p1624724301168000"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6QHRz"}]}]
